:: Departure warning [nobr]
/* Interstitial shown by setup.relationshipBetween.departureWarningRedirect when a friend's departure pushed a guest over the walk-out line */
<<set _departureWarningNext = $game.departureWarningNext ?? 'Wood cabin'>>
<<run delete $game.departureWarningNext>>
<<departureWarnings>>
<br />
<<link "Continue" _departureWarningNext>><</link>>
